※ pl4g-test: module
※※ What the program beside this one reads before it starts.
※
※ Not a test of its own but a module the test beside it imports.  Its
※ `constinit` variable is lowered only because the program names it, and its
※ initializer runs before the program's own.

※※ Seven, worked out at start: what the auxiliary vector says is no constant.
@[export]
constinit let seed: u64 = seven(⎕auxv(6) ?? 0u64)

fn seven(page: u64) → u64:
    if page = 0u64: 7u64 else: 7u64
